Kaatkar Naize Pe Aada Ne Chadaya Sar Ko<br>
<br>
Yaad Karti Rahi Tanhayi Me Sughra Paiham<br>
Kabhi Shabbir Ko Akbar Ko Kabhi Asghar Ko<br>
<br>
Khoud Kar Qabar Gala Kata Mere Pyare Ka<br>
Hai Turbat Main Bhi Na Chain Mila Asghar Ko<br>
<br>
